      seo_p1: 'Looking for <strong>shop software</strong>? shopcos soft is the complete <strong>point of sale (POS) software</strong> designed for retailers in 31 countries. Whether you run a <a href="blog/grocery-store-pos-software.html">grocery store</a>, pharmacy, garment shop, mobile shop, electronics store, or any retail business — our <strong>billing software</strong> handles everything from fast barcode billing to customer credit management. Available in 28 currencies with multi-language support.',
